Performance and Optimization 
1. Compression middleware Reduces response size, lowering bandwidth usage and improving response times. 

2. Optimizing file I/O - Use asynchronous I/O (fs.promises). - Cache frequently accessed data in memory. - Batch writes to reduce file operations. 

3.Caching implementation - Use in-memory caching (e.g., Redis) for frequent queries. - Implement ETag or Last-Modified headers for HTTP caching.
